url: "https://github.com/FaizPalwala/virtual-id-gen"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FaizPalwala/virtual-id-gen"
abstract: >
  A synthetic, identity-conditioned face dataset of 45,000 images
  (600 identities × 75 images, plus a companion imbalanced variant with an
  85:40:20 popularity gradient) generated via InstantID + Juggernaut-XL-v9
  from CC0 synthetic SFHQ seed images.  Designed as a benchmark for machine
  unlearning with identity-level split isolation (retain 450 / test 90 /
  forget 60 identities) and a sequential 15-step forgetting protocol.
  Images are 224×224 aligned face crops with proxy age-group labels and
  confound-control columns (arcface similarity, sharpness, detection
  confidence, gender).
keywords:
